57 command E Mon 10:50am L=[88] ['You go east.', 'You are on the east side. To the west there is a sandstone bridge. To the north there is a deep stream. Visible exits are southeast. You can see Chief Constable Straker and a female corpse. On the female corpse there is a crumpled note.\n Inspector Lestrade enters.\n Watson enters.\n Chief Constable Straker remarks to Inspector Lestrade" Mrs Brown\'s husband was killed about five years ago, he was a top scientist working on some secret project. Apparently there was some mystery involved in his death but nothing was ever discovered and I hear the plans for his project were never seen again. She was very well liked by the people around here.".']
